WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:01.830
- Alright we've reached that moment,

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.770
where I share some magic
from the inter webs.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.253
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.135 --> 00:00:09.078
(crowd cheers and applauds)

00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:11.980
When some dude named
Chad says, "hold my beer"

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:14.730
it's usually not a good sign.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:15.720
Not the case though.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.130
At a party in New Jersey a few weeks ago,

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.940
when party goers spotted a
baby deer had fallen in the

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.080
water. This particular, Chad,

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.380
didn't hesitate to jump
in and check this out.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.710
- Oh my god, it's gonna die.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.633
- What if he doesn't get it?

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:33.382
(crowd chatter)

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:35.437
- I'm not going to let them die here.

00:00:35.437 --> 00:00:36.695
- Go get him, go get him.

00:00:36.695 --> 00:00:37.587
- Here, I'll take that.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.725
- Where's he going to get out?

00:00:39.725 --> 00:00:41.756
It's a baby deer.

00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:42.787
- Oh my god.

00:00:42.787 --> 00:00:45.537
(water splashes)

00:00:46.443 --> 00:00:47.943
- This is awesome.

00:00:48.931 --> 00:00:52.314
(crowd chattering)

00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:54.773
(laughing)

00:00:54.773 --> 00:00:55.731
- He's out,

00:00:55.731 --> 00:00:57.334
look he got him!

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.288
(crowd cheers)

00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:01.327
- Alright, that video was seen on TikTok,

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.250
over 7 million times.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.169
Chad is clearly a hero
to all woodland creatures

00:01:04.169 --> 00:01:08.700
and he's dialed in now watching
on our partner station,

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.432
NBC for New York. So Chad,
what made you jump in?

00:01:12.432 --> 00:01:14.822
(crowd applause)

00:01:14.822 --> 00:01:15.830
- Thank you.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:16.663
So Kelly,

00:01:16.663 --> 00:01:20.560
I was actually at a party down
in Tom's River and my wife

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.440
ran over to me and told me
that there was a baby deer that

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:26.920
was drowning in the lagoon.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.810
So that's when I took to myself
and ran over to that dock,

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:33.663
took that shirt off, got
that money out of my pocket,

00:01:34.556 --> 00:01:36.640
made sure my phone wasn't in my pocket

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.160
and went right at it and had to just get

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.340
across that water, save that baby deer.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:43.172
- Oh, it's so cute.

00:01:43.172 --> 00:01:44.172
(crowd cheers)

00:01:44.172 --> 00:01:46.700
- But the best part is what happens next.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.580
So tell us.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:49.723
- So we had went on,

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.380
made a couple phone calls to
try and find someone to help us

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.500
with this deer. Cause we
didn't know what to do with it.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.230
It was 4th of July weekend.
Nobody was answering.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.370
We wound up actually taking
it upon ourselves to go on

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.790
Google maps,

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:05.342
found an actual small patch of
woods that was near where I'd

00:02:05.342 --> 00:02:07.170
got the deer.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.010
And me and my wife went on a
little venture in our truck and

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:11.843
sure enough,

00:02:11.843 --> 00:02:16.100
the baby deer's mother was
standing there waiting for us

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.400
right at the tennis courts over there.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.000
We got out of the car.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.090
And if you look in the back of this video,

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.820
actually you'll see the mother
deer standing back in that

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:25.653
greenhouse.

00:02:25.653 --> 00:02:29.118
You can see her right back there
and they went off together.

00:02:29.118 --> 00:02:29.951
- What?

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.640
That's so crazy.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.310
You're like a male Snow White right now.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:38.030
I love it. Chad.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:41.290
It's so amazing. Thank you so
much for sharing that video.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.460
It made all of us very happy.

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.980
I'm liking your posts right now.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.071
(bell dings)

00:02:47.071 --> 00:02:48.250
- That is so awesome.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.450
- No, well that's not all,

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.100
our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.700
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:56.470
wants to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you, my man.

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:59.600
So they will be using their
G2 gelling pen to write you a

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.450
check for a thousand
dollars. How's that sound?

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.200
(crowd cheering)

00:03:06.039 --> 00:03:06.872
- Yeah!

